%% PROPOSED server-enforced run state machine (guards: architecture.md section 5)
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> RECEIVED
  RECEIVED --> NEEDS_CLARIFICATION: slot missing or ambiguous
  NEEDS_CLARIFICATION --> RECEIVED: slot_answers, same user, within 10 min
  RECEIVED --> REJECTED: unsupported, negated, clinical, forbidden, not_available
  RECEIVED --> AUTHORIZED: unique action, slots resolved, pre-check ok
  AUTHORIZED --> EXECUTING: R0
  AUTHORIZED --> NEEDS_CONFIRMATION: R1 to R3, preview and plan_hash
  NEEDS_CONFIRMATION --> NEEDS_CONFIRMATION: plan changed
  NEEDS_CONFIRMATION --> EXECUTING: confirm, hash ok, not expired, CAS
  NEEDS_CONFIRMATION --> CANCELLED: cancel
  NEEDS_CONFIRMATION --> EXPIRED: 5 min
  EXECUTING --> VERIFYING: 2xx
  EXECUTING --> FAILED: 4xx
  EXECUTING --> UNKNOWN_OUTCOME: timeout, 5xx or stuck over 2 min
  EXECUTING --> PARTIALLY_COMPLETED: playbook later step failed
  EXECUTING --> NEEDS_CONFIRMATION: playbook step input diverged from preview (remaining steps only)
  VERIFYING --> COMPLETED_VERIFIED: read-back matches
  VERIFYING --> UNKNOWN_OUTCOME: mismatch or read failed
  UNKNOWN_OUTCOME --> COMPLETED_VERIFIED: re-verify ok
  UNKNOWN_OUTCOME --> FAILED: re-verify shows not written
  UNKNOWN_OUTCOME --> NEEDS_HUMAN: 3 attempts undecided
  COMPLETED_VERIFIED --> [*]
  FAILED --> [*]
  REJECTED --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> [*]
  EXPIRED --> [*]
  PARTIALLY_COMPLETED --> [*]
  NEEDS_HUMAN --> [*]
